## Transform

```bash
{% if include_sample -%}
opm transform data/sample.xml --preview
opm transform data/sample.xml -t markdown --preview
opm transform data/sample.xml -t typst -o output.typ
opm transform data/sample.xml -t docx -o output.docx
{% else -%}
opm transform your.xml --preview
opm transform your.xml -t markdown --preview
opm transform your.xml -t typst -o output.typ
opm transform your.xml -t docx -o output.docx
{% endif -%}
```

## Chunk and preview

```bash
{% if include_sample -%}
opm chunk data/sample.xml --force
{% else -%}
opm chunk your.xml --force
{% endif -%}
opm serve
```

